    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/8/48777.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 155,
    "turn_text": "Right. But, you know, that some Democrats take the position these days that, hell no, we're not going to work with people at the other party. No, no, no, not at all. We're not going to work with them. We want, we don't think our job is to meet them halfway. They need to come, they need to come to us.",
